      "summary_en": "While in combat Gnar generates Rage. At maximum Rage his next ability will transform him into Mega Gnar, granting increased survivability and access to new spells.",
      "summary_zh": "在战斗时，纳尔会产生怒气。在怒气到达最大值时，他的下一个技能将使他变形成巨型纳尔，获得强化的生存能力并能使用新的技能。",
