      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Gnar's attacks and spells hype him up, dealing bonus damage and granting him Move Speed. Mega Gnar is too enraged to be hyper and instead can rear up on his hind legs and smash down on the area in front of him, stunning enemies in an area.",
      "summary_zh": "纳尔的攻击和施法会让他亢奋起来，造成额外伤害并为他提供移动速度加成。 巨型纳尔已经过于暴怒，所以用不着亢奋了，因此他会用后脚暴跳，并猛击他面前的区域，使区域内的所有敌人晕眩。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1331676:3932657",
        "source:wiki:1331677:4022698"
      ]
